/Alt (A two-panel graph showing weekly retail petrol and diesel prices in Australia. The left panel shows petrol and diesel prices since 2021 and the right panel shows these prices since the beginning of 2026. Both retail diesel and petrol prices peaked around March and April 2026, with diesel reaching a  higher peak of more than 300c/L compared with petrol at around 250c/L. Fuel prices have since increased from July onward alongside the unwind of the fuel excise reduction and re-escalation of the Middle East conflict. Diesel and petrol prices  in October were a bit below the peaks observed earlier in the year.)
/K 9
/Type /StructElem
/S /Figure
